      "name": "ticket.ts",
      "filePath": "packages/opencode/src/pty/ticket.ts",
      "summary": "One-time PTY connect-ticket service backed by an Effect Cache with a 60-second TTL: issue() mints a UUID bound to a pty/directory/workspace scope and consume() atomically invalidates it only when the scopes match.",
      "tags": ["service", "security", "tickets", "cache", "effect"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "Uses Cache.set/invalidateWhen as a TTL-scoped one-shot store; the cache lookup intentionally dies because get() is never a valid operation on tickets."
    },
