      "type": "document",
      "name": "AGENTS.md",
      "filePath": "packages/opencode/src/search/AGENTS.md",
      "summary": "Architecture guidance for the search subsystem: documents ZvecIndex's low-level contract and dimension-precedence rules, the manifest adjacency invariant, coded native errors, EmbeddingService's lazy config resolution, and the dynamic-import pattern that keeps the 13 MB ONNX/WASM runtime out of module load.",
      "tags": ["documentation", "architecture", "search", "embeddings", "agent-guidance"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:packages/opencode/src/search/embedding.ts",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "embedding.ts",
      "filePath": "packages/opencode/src/search/embedding.ts",
      "summary": "Embedding service with two lazily constructed backends: a local pure-WASM ONNX runtime running all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (hand-rolled BERT WordPiece tokenizer, mean pooling, HuggingFace download cache) and an OpenAI API provider, selected from config on first use.",
      "tags": ["service", "embeddings", "onnx", "machine-learning", "lazy-init"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "onnxruntime-web and the 13 MB WASM binaries must be dynamically imported inside createLocalProvider; static imports would eagerly load the runtime at module parse time even when semantic search is never used."
    },
